用数值、方向符号和文字说明相对上期的变化，颜色只作辅助；金融场景还要遵循当地颜色约定","desc_en":"Use numbers, directional symbols, and text to describe change from the previous period. Use color only as a supporting cue, and follow local financial color conventions where relevant."}]},"variants":[{"cn":"基础数值","en":"Basic","demo":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">文章总数</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Total number of articles</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span></span>","when":"只需展示当前值，不需要比较趋势时","when_en":"When you only need to display the current value and do not need to compare trends"},{"cn":"带趋势","en":"Trend","demo":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">本周新增</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">New this week</span><span class=\"s-value\">1,024</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span>","when":"需要与上期或目标值对比时","when_en":"When it is necessary to compare with the previous period or target value"},{"cn":"带单位","en":"Unit","demo":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">当前在线</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>人</small></span></span><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">存储空间</span><span class=\"s-value\">6.6<small>GB</small></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Online now</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>people</small></span></span><span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Storage</span><span class=\"s-value\">6.6<small>GB</small></span></span>","when":"数值需要说明量纲时补充单位","when_en":"When a number needs a unit to be understood"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>仪表盘核心指标</b>：销售额、活跃用户","m":"stat-dashboard"},{"t":"带<b>涨跌趋势</b>，对比当前值与基准期","m":"stat-trend"},{"t":"<b>实时数据</b>：在线人数、秒杀倒计时","m":"stat-count"},{"t":"<b>卡片里</b>的辅助小指标","m":"stat-card"}],"dont":[{"t":"展示<b>任务不需要的精度</b>，会增加理解负担","m":"stat-decimal","bad":true},{"t":"<b>同一区域展示过多大数字</b>，会削弱重点","m":"stat-mess","bad":true},{"t":"表达<b>完成进度</b>：使用 {c:progress}","m":"pg-storage"},{"t":"用户需要<b>状态结论</b>而非数字：使用 {c:tag}","m":"stat-as-tag","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"运营看板要说明本周订单表现，数据是 486 笔，比上周增加 12%。怎样展示才能让人看懂这个变化？","options":[{"id":"value-with-benchmark","label":"突出“本周订单 486 笔”，并注明“较上周增加 12%”","feedback":"指标名称、当前值、单位和比较基准都明确，用户才能理解数字代表什么变化。","correct":true},{"id":"trend-only","label":"只放醒目的“↑12%”，把订单数量和比较对象省略","feedback":"涨幅没有说明是什么指标、相对哪个时期，无法支持业务判断。","correct":false},{"id":"progress-for-count","label":"改用 12% 进度条表示本周订单，让用户从长度判断表现","feedback":"进度条需要明确目标总量；当前数据描述的是订单数量和环比，不是完成进度。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"An operations dashboard reports 486 orders this week, up 12% from last week. How should it show the number and comparison clearly?","options":[{"id":"value-with-benchmark","label":"Emphasize 486 orders this week and add Up 12% from last week","feedback":"Metric name, current value, unit, and benchmark are all explicit, so the change can be understood.","correct":true},{"id":"trend-only","label":"Show only a large ↑12% and omit the order count and comparison period","feedback":"A percentage without the metric or comparison period cannot support a business judgment.","correct":false},{"id":"progress-for-count","label":"Use a 12% progress bar for weekly orders and let its length communicate performance","feedback":"Progress needs a defined target. This data describes a count and period-over-period change, not completion.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把本周订单做成统计数值：主值显示 486 笔，辅助信息明确“较上周增加 12%”。不要只显示箭头或百分比；同时处理无上周数据、下降和数据更新时间三种情况。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Present weekly orders as a statistic: show 486 orders as the main value and Up 12% from last week as context. Do not show an arrow or percentage alone. Handle no prior data, decline, and last-updated time."}},"demoDetail":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">本月销售额</span><span class=\"s-value\">¥ 864,000</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">活跃用户</span><span class=\"s-value\">12,846</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 8.3%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">当前在线</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>人</small></span><span class=\"s-trend down\">↓ 2.1%</span></span>","scenes":["数据仪表盘","运营周报","活动实时大屏","账户余额"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Sales this month</span><span class=\"s-value\">¥ 864,000</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 12.5%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Active users</span><span class=\"s-value\">12,846</span><span class=\"s-trend up\">↑ 8.3%</span></span>\n  <span class=\"stat-d\"><span class=\"s-label\">Currently online</span><span class=\"s-value\">3,872<small>people</small></span><span class=\"s-trend down\">↓ 2.1%</span></span>","use":[{"t":"Key performance indicator","m":"stat-dashboard"},{"t":"Account balance","m":"stat-trend"},{"t":"Progress total","m":"stat-count"},{"t":"A small dashboard summary","m":"stat-card"}],"dont":[{"t":"Show a number without its label or unit","m":"stat-decimal","bad":true},{"t":"Use color alone to explain whether a change is good","m":"stat-mess","bad":true},{"t":"Compare different time periods without saying so","m":"pg-storage"},{"t":"Place so many statistics together that none stands out","m":"stat-as-tag","bad":true}],"scenes":["Analytics dashboard","Sales summary","Account overview","Campaign report"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:stretch\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">This month’s sales</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text);line-height:1.3;margin-top:2px\">¥ 864,000</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--gree